Name: retro_games
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-12-19
Author: ChatGPT + Marcos Laia
Maintainer: Marcos Laia <marcos@example.com>
Title: Libretro-based Emulator Access (NES/GBA/SNES/MegaDrive/SMS/GG/Atari)
Description: Provide a thin Octave wrapper to use Libretro cores for classic consoles
  (NES, GBA, SNES, MegaDrive, Master System, Game Gear and Atari 2600),
  exposing a RetroGame object with methods to step the emulator, send input,
  grab video frames and save/load full emulator state.
Categories: Graphics;Simulation;Games
License: GPLv3+
Url: https://github.com/marcos-laia/retro_games
Autoload: no
Depends: octave (>= 7.0.0)
